    "chunk_text": "Ic Beda Cristes \u00feeow and m\u00e6ssepreost sende gretan \u00f0one leofastan cyning Ceolwulf. & ic \u00f0e sende \u00fe\u00e6t spell, \u00fe\u00e6t ic niwan awrat be Angel\u00feeode & Seaxum, \u00f0e sylfum to r\u00e6danne & on & ic getreowige on \u00f0ine geornfulnysse, for\u00feon \u00f0u eart swy\u00f0e gymende & smeagende ealdra manna For\u00f0on \u00feis gewrit o\u00f0\u00f0e hit god saga\u00f0 be godum mannum, & se \u00f0e hit gehyre\u00fe, he onhyre\u00fe \u00feam, o\u00f0\u00f0e For\u00feon hit is god godne to herianne & yfelne to leanne, \u00fe\u00e6t se ge\u00f0eo se \u00fee hit gehyre. Gif se o\u00f0er nolde, hu wur\u00f0 he elles gel\u00e6red? For \u00feinre \u00f0earfe & for \u00feinre \u00f0eode ic \u00feis awrat; for\u00feon \u00f0e God to cyninge geceas, \u00fee gedafena\u00f0 \u00feine & \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0y l\u00e6s tweoge hw\u00e6\u00f0er \u00feis so\u00f0 sy, ic cy\u00f0e hwanan me \u00feas spell coman. \u00c6rest me w\u00e6s fultumiend & lareow se arwur\u00f0a abbad Albinus, se w\u00e6s wide gefaren & gel\u00e6red, & Swy\u00f0ost he me s\u00e6de of \u00feeodores gemynde, se w\u00e6s biscop on Cantwara byrig, & Adrianus abbud, Eall \u00fe\u00e6t he on Cantwara m\u00e6g\u00fee & eac on \u00feam \u00feeodlandum \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r to ge\u00f0eodde w\u00e6ron, eall \u00f0\u00e6t he Fram fruman \u00feyssa boca o\u00f0 \u00fea tid, \u00fee Angelcyn Cristes geleafan onfeng, of ealldra manna s\u00e6genum; Swy\u00f0e fela hi me s\u00e6don fram gehwylcum biscopum, & hwylcum cyninga tidum",
